{
  "id": "elevator",
  "title": "What happens if an elevator cable snaps?",
  "lang": "en-gb",
  "voice": {
    "bm_george": 0.6,
    "bm_fable": 0.4
  },
  "leadIn": 0.05,
  "gap": 0.06,
  "tail": 1.4,
  "handle": "@explainland",
  "scene": "elevator",
  "hook": {
    "line1": "WHAT IF AN ELEVATOR",
    "line2": "CABLE SNAPS?"
  },
  "outro": {
    "line1": "STILL TAKING",
    "line2": "THE STAIRS?"
  },
  "recapItems": [
    "ROPES",
    "COUNTERWEIGHT",
    "BRAKE",
    "GOVERNOR",
    "SAFETY WEDGES",
    "BUFFERS"
  ],
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Your elevator's cable just snapped. Would you fall?",
      "speed": 1.2,
      "shot": "followCar",
      "event": "hook",
      "highlight": [
        "snapped",
        "fall"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's rewind. Here's why that almost never happens.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "followCar",
      "event": "rewind",
      "highlight": [
        "rewind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "First, there isn't one cable. There are four to eight...",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "carTop",
      "event": "ropes",
      "label": "HOIST ROPES",
      "labelWord": "four",
      "labelAt": "ropes",
      "highlight": [
        "four",
        "eight"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and each one could hold the whole car by itself.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "carTop",
      "event": "eachRope",
      "highlight": [
        "itself"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the other side, a heavy counterweight balances the car.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "shaftWide",
      "event": "counterweight",
      "label": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
      "labelWord": "counterweight",
      "labelAt": "cw",
      "highlight": [
        "counterweight"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Up top, the motor's brake is held open by electricity. Cut the power, and springs slam it shut.",
      "speed": 1.3,
      "shot": "machineRoom",
      "event": "brake",
      "label": "BRAKE",
      "labelWord": "brake",
      "labelAt": [
        0.55,
        20.9,
        0.5
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "brake",
        "slam"
      ],
      "hold": 0.2
    },
    {
      "text": "But what if every single rope snaps?",
      "speed": 1.2,
      "shot": "shaftWide",
      "event": "allSnap",
      "highlight": [
        "every",
        "snaps"
      ],
      "hold": 0.2
    },
    {
      "text": "A second wheel, the governor, senses the car speeding up...",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "governorClose",
      "event": "governor",
      "label": "GOVERNOR",
      "labelWord": "governor",
      "labelAt": [
        -1.25,
        20.2,
        0.3
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "governor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and yanks a lever. Steel wedges bite into the rails.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "wedgeClose",
      "event": "wedges",
      "label": "SAFETY BRAKES",
      "labelWord": "wedges",
      "labelAt": "wedges",
      "highlight": [
        "wedges",
        "bite"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The car stops within a few metres.",
      "speed": 1.2,
      "shot": "followCar",
      "event": "stop",
      "highlight": [
        "stops"
      ],
      "hold": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "This trick is old. In the 1850s, Elisha Otis cut his own elevator's rope in front of a crowd...",
      "speed": 1.3,
      "shot": "otis",
      "event": "otis",
      "highlight": [
        "Otis",
        "cut"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and didn't fall.",
      "speed": 1.15,
      "shot": "otis",
      "event": "otisSafe",
      "highlight": [
        "didn't"
      ],
      "hold": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "And if even that fails?",
      "speed": 1.2,
      "shot": "followCar",
      "event": "elseFails",
      "highlight": [
        "fails"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Giant springs and oil buffers wait at the bottom.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "pitShot",
      "event": "buffers",
      "label": "BUFFERS",
      "labelWord": "buffers",
      "labelAt": [
        -0.2,
        -0.9,
        0.6
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "buffers"
      ],
      "hold": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Ropes. Counterweight. Brake. Governor. Safety wedges. Buffers.",
      "speed": 1.15,
      "shot": "shaftWide",
      "event": "recap",
      "highlight": [
        "ropes",
        "counterweight",
        "brake",
        "governor",
        "safety",
        "buffers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That's how elevators in the US make about eighteen billion trips a year.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "buildingWide",
      "event": "payoff",
      "highlight": [
        "eighteen",
        "billion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Still taking the stairs? Tell me in the comments.",
      "speed": 1.2,
      "shot": "final",
      "event": "final",
      "highlight": [
        "stairs",
        "comments"
      ]
    }
  ]
}